{"ref":"BDB, קֶ֫סֶם","hw":"קֶ֫סֶם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קֶ֫סֶם</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>divination</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 23:23\" href=\"/Numbers.23.23\">Nu 23:23</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">קָ֑סֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:26\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.26\">Ez 21:26</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">קֶסֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.6\">13:6</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְסָמִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 18:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.18.10\">Dt 18:10</a> +;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  of the nations: Balaam, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 23:23\" href=\"/Numbers.23.23\">Nu 23:23</a> (poem in JE; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נַחַשׁ</span>; c. ב <em>against;</em> as acc. cogn. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִקְסָם־ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:26\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.26\">Ez 21:26</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> as instr. of divination <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּימִינוֹ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.27\">27</a>; so of elders of Moab and Midian, <span dir=\"rtl\">קְסָמִים בְּיָדָם</span>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:7\" href=\"/Numbers.22.7\">Nu 22:7</a> (E).—<a data-ref=\"Isaiah 2:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.2.6\">Is 2:6</a> v. [<a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, קָסַס\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_קָסַס\">קָסַם</a>].<br><strong>2.</strong>  of false proph. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ כָּזָב</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.6\">Ez 13:6</a> (but v. [<a data-ref=\"BDB, קָסַס\" href=\"/BDB,_קָסַס\", dir=\"rtl\">קָסַם</a>]); <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> as acc. cogn. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.23\">Ez 13:23</a> (< Co Berthol Krae <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּזָב</span> as v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.9\">9</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:34\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.34\">21:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:28\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.28\">22:28</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ אֱלִיל</span> (so Gf for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">וֶאֱלִו֯ל</span>) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.14\">Je 14:14</a> (all ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חזה שׁוא</span> or <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁקר</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">קֹסֵם קְסָמִים</span> prohibited <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 18:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.18.10\">Dt 18:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 17:17\" href=\"/II_Kings.17.17\">2 K 17:17</a>; reprobated <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:23\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.23\">1 S 15:23</a> (poem; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תרפים</span>).<br><strong>3.</strong>  in good sense <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ עַל שִׂפְתֵי מֶלֶךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.10\">Pr 16:10</a> (king’s lips as oracle).","next":"BDB, קָסַם","prev":"BDB, קסם"}